  "status": 200,
  "finalUrl": "https://www.avo.tv/",
  "title": "AVO TV - Free TV for Africa",
  "text": "How to Watch Watch Online Watch on Satellite Blog Watch over 120 TV channels on your mobile, streaming device, or satellite TV. Entertainment Local Movies Sports News + much more AVO TV is Africa's leading free-to-air streaming platform. Now available on satellite and all major streaming and mobile platforms, AVO is watched by over 20 million viewers globally. Watch AVO TV today and never pay for a TV subscription ever again. Watch AVO on all your favourite devices Watch on the web Watch on your mobile or tablet Watch on your Smart TV or Streaming Device Watch on free-to-air satellite. Available across Sub-Sahaan Africa on Intelsat 20 at 68.5 degrees east. How To Watch Online 1. Download Download the AVO app from the app store on your favourite device and gain access to over 120 TV channels immediately. No sign up or payment required...ever! 2. Register Register on the AVO TV app and get access to hundreds of the latest local movies. Sign-up is free and the only personal detail we require is your email address. 3. Watch Anywhere To make sure you get the best from AVO, you can download the app on all your favourite devices. Watch AVO on your mobile, tablet, or Smart TV. Watch now How To Watch On Satellite 1. Point your Dish at 68.5 Degrees East If your dish is not already pointing at Intelsat 20, adjust the position of your satellite reciever to face 68.5 degrees east to pick up a signal from AVO TV's satellite package. 2. Rescan your Set-Top-Box Once your receiver has locked onto Intelsat 20, do a auto rescan via your set-top-box to make sure you are able to access all channels on the platform. 3. Browse EPG on your mobile Even if you don't want to stream live TV from the AVO mobile app, you can use it to browse the TV guide for all channels and catch-up on any shows you missed. More Details Data Save Mode How To Download Terms of Service Privacy Policy Contact AVO TV Limited 2025",
